{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100574","id":2242846016,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Frx1A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100574","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100574.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100574.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100574","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100574/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100574/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100574/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2e0783943562594961a75d0ae79618ce544c8dc1","number":100574,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add primitive 2D meshes","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds `RectangleMesh2D`, `CircleMesh2D`, and `CapsuleMesh2D`, inheriting from the virtual base class `PrimitiveMesh2D`.\r\n\r\nAllows drawing 2D shapes by using the *existing* (but so far perhaps underused) `MeshInstance2D` node:\r\n\r\n![primitive_mesh_2d](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39248985-1478-4acc-b113-90a79ad1b3bf)\r\n\r\nExample project: [godot-primitive-mesh-2d.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18187813/godot-primitive-mesh-2d.zip)\r\n\r\n![primitive_mesh_2d_examples](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be7e5097-3d6e-4764-8c74-b758d94d35d1)\r\n\r\nThe two fancy shapes on the right are obtained by applying vertex shaders to primitive meshes (kind of silly, but it works).\r\n\r\n~~If you want a triangle, use a `Polygon2D` instead.~~\r\n\r\nThe code is based on the code for primitive 3D meshes.\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1126","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","ava